<title>HONG KONG: Kumagai cites progress on spinoff plan.</title>
<headline>Kumagai cites progress on spinoff plan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kumagai Gumi (Hong Kong) Ltd has won preliminary approval from the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong's listing committee to list its China infrastructure unit, the South China Morning Post said on Friday, quoting chairman Yu Ching-po.</p>
<p>Yu was quoted as saying the timing wuld depend on further developments in Yangpu industrial zone, Hainan province, where the infrastructure project is located, and market conditions.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
